NAME
    gcloud observability trace-scopes - manage Trace Scope resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud observability trace-scopes COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Manage Trace Scope resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        Create traceScopes.

     delete
        Delete traceScopes.

     describe
        Describe traceScopes.

     list
        List traceScopes.

     update
        Update traceScopes.

NOTES
    These variants are also available:

        $ gcloud alpha observability trace-scopes

        $ gcloud beta observability trace-scopes

